 "note": "M, 15 platforms, choke, inward. The T4 in the middle stands on its own island, joined only up to the top crossing and down to the bottom one. Each home's front platform is a launch pad aimed straight over the gap at it: arm the pad, walk a line in, and it lands on the T4 two seconds later instead of going round three bridges. Point-symmetric. Survivor ring: the T4, the crossings and the pads' platforms.",
